                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "+Prank your friend in VR\n+Lots of \"Mini-Games\" All with the purpose of terrifying your friends\n+Entertaining for a group\n\n-Not really that great\n-Gets boring after one or two jokes\n-Some of the games don't work properly\n-Feels a little cheaply made\n\n2.5/5\n\nThis would be a Neutral Review If it could be. \n\nAlthough it makes for a fun time with friends and family, this \"Game\" is really just an application to prank your friends and probably break your headset. It's fun, quirky, and interesting. However I can't fully recommend it as it feels cheap, and gets boring quick when you know that every one of these \"experiences\" are made for freaking you/someone you're with out. I can't recommend it, especially for $20.\n\n[Quote] If you liked this review Make sure to [url=https://store.steampowered.com/curator/33220185-VR-Games-and-Tools/]Click here[/url] and give a follow for more reviews of good, bad and decent VR titles. And [url=https://steamcommunity.com/groups/HonestVR/]Click here[/url] if you want to request reviews on other VR titles. [/Quote]",
